## Context
report.tex line 4 loads `\usepackage{unicode-math}` but uses no unicode math
features. Same situation as slides before gh#185. Removing it eliminates
font-scan warnings from tectonic builds.

## Actions
1. Remove `\usepackage{unicode-math}` from report.tex
2. Verify `tectonic report.tex` builds cleanly with fewer warnings

## Exit criteria
- report.pdf builds without unicode-math font warnings
- No math rendering regressions
